===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|ieiunum|lang=la}}, neuter of {{term|ieiunus|iēiūnus}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/dʒiːˈdʒuːnəm/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|jejuna}}

# {{context|anatomy|lang=en}} The central of the three divisions of the [[small intestine]] which lies between the [[duodenum]] and the [[ileum]].

